  m_Name: Carta_LinhaDeOnibus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Linha de \xD4nibus"
  _titleEn: Bus Line
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Uma linha de \xF4nibus nova liga bairros a empregos e servi\xE7os e
    tira carros das ruas."
  _summaryEn: A new bus line connects neighborhoods to jobs and services and takes
    cars off the streets.
  _realWorld: "Curitiba implantou em 1974 as canaletas exclusivas para \xF4nibus,
    origem do BRT; o sistema integra linhas e tarifa em toda a regi\xE3o."
  _realWorldEn: Curitiba introduced dedicated bus lanes in 1974, the origin of BRT;
    its system integrates routes and fares across the region.
  _tradeOffs: "\xD4nibus precisam de subs\xEDdio para manter a tarifa acess\xEDvel,
    e linhas lotadas ou lentas perdem passageiros para o carro."
  _tradeOffsEn: Buses need subsidies to keep fares affordable, and crowded or slow
    lines lose riders to cars.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Rede Integrada de Transporte (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rede_Integrada_de_Transporte
